{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3tFBgphJXJEWjxeteu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*A heavy oak door stands before you, ancient and weathered. Iron studs dot its surface in geometric patterns. A rusted keyhole glows faintly.*\n\n**CLICK.**\n\n*The tumblers turn. The wood groans. A thin line of pale light splits the darkness as I crack open, just barely, revealing nothing but a whisper of cold air from the other side.*\n\n*I am ajar.*\n\n*Will you push through?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":102,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}